SCHEDULE

-- Outside the sector, drawing its own side of the fault down at a steady rate.
-- The sector can only feel that through the connections across the fault, and
-- sealed off from them it would sit at its initial 300 bar throughout.
WELSPECS
  'P1' 'G1' 1 1 1* 'OIL' /
/

COMPDAT
  'P1' 1 1 1 4 'OPEN' 2* 0.2 /
/

WCONPROD
  'P1' 'OPEN' 'ORAT' 20.0 4* 50.0 /
/

TSTEP
  10*10 /

END
